            <ArticleTitle>Meaning in suffering.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>174-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article deals with the dual suffering of clients and nurses when facing situations which appear to have no meaning. It demonstrates the need for the nurse to develop a personal philosophy which may be used to help both herself and her client.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
